ps://forum.rdfzer.com/c/general/4","text":"卮言","kind":"link","postNumber":8},{"href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/8/849efaec10e0295f6c6d27fb9087b92cefb15792.jpeg","text":"[A screenshot shows a page of a Chinese text document displayed within a PDF viewer on a computer screen. (Captioned by AI)]","kind":"upload","postNumber":8},{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/3055","text":"不生不死不茫茫","kind":"link","postNumber":9},{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/u/gggggg","text":"@gggggg","kind":"link","postNumber":9},{"href":"https://bdfz.yuque.com/org-wiki-bdfz-oz9uor/yrhg03/aqo192?singleDoc#","text":"江城子·乙卯正月二十日夜记梦/苏轼 · BDFZ","kind":"link","postNumber":11},{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/ykWTCYPnpF44GHcHsVeN2R8dnH5.pdf","text":"Pages from 钦定词谱.40卷.清.陈廷敬.王奕清等奉敕纂修.清康熙54年内府刊朱墨套印本.1715年.pdf","kind":"document","postNumber":12}],"resourceCounts":{"external":10,"attachment":4,"document":2},"annotations":[{"title":"教材圖頁","body":"已對應教材圖片 p52 起，可在圖頁欄對照原書版面、頁碼和課文位置。"},{"title":"延伸資源","body":"本課從論壇回覆抽取 21 條連結/附件，按所在樓層保留，便於追溯。"},{"title":"論壇圖片","body":"本課含 6 張 R2/Discourse 圖片，已按原貼樓層關聯到課文。"},{"title":"學習路線","body":"先讀主樓，旁看教材圖頁，再用回覆資源補證據；最後把自己的問題丟給 AI 或討論區。"}],"learningTasks":[{"id":"restate","title":"三分鐘復述","prompt":"不看原文，用三分鐘說清《江城子·乙卯正月二十日夜记梦/苏轼》的核心問題、人物/論點與一句最關鍵的證據。"},{"id":"evidence","title":"證據標註","prompt":"從主樓或教材圖頁中選兩處原文，分別標出：字面意思、語氣/修辭、可被考查的點。"},{"id":"transfer","title":"遷移追問","prompt":"結合回覆中的一條學習資源，設計一道可討論的問題，要求回答者必須回到文本取證。"}],"posts":[{"id":10084,"post_number":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-07T02:59:24Z","updated_at":"2024-08-17T06:13:29Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<blockquote>\n<p>选自《东坡乐府笺》卷一（上海古籍出版社2009年版）。</p>\n<p>这首词作于宋神宗熙宁八年（1075），是苏轼在密州（今山东诸城）做知州时悼念妻子王弗的作品。王弗去世于宋英宗治平二年（1065）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>十年生死两茫茫<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-1\">[1]</a></sup>。不思量，自难忘。</p>\n<p>千里孤坟<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-2\">[2]</a></sup>，无处话凄凉。</p>\n<p>纵使相逢应不识，尘满面，鬓如霜。</p>\n<p>夜来幽梦<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-3\">[3]</a></sup>忽还乡。小轩窗<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-4\">[4]</a></sup>，正梳妆。</p>\n<p>相顾无言，惟有泪千行。</p>\n<p>料得年年肠断处，明月夜，短松冈<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-10084-5\" id=\"footnote-ref-10084-5\">[5]</a></sup>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>生死相隔，深情难忘。这首悼亡词一开篇便抒发作者对妻子诚笃的感情。</p>\n<p>生死，是一种隔；</p>\n<p>妻子葬于千里外的故乡，是一种隔；</p>\n<p>岁月沧桑，即使相逢也认不出，又是一种隔；</p>\n<p>梦中还乡，四目相对，千言万语无从谈起，还是一种隔。</p>\n<p>在对梦境的淡淡追述中，将死别之悲、独处之苦、世路之艰写得极为沉痛。</p>\n<p>诵读这首词，留意细节描写，体会作者是如何把梦境的记述、对亡妻的思念和落拓的身世之感融合在一起的。</p>\n<p>生死相念，茫茫的是岁月时光，横亘的，是无变相思。</p>\n<p>生死，有念；</p>\n<p>千里孤坟，一话或无话，是念；</p>\n<p>相守未终老，阴阳隔断，使尘鬓不识，但，我念。</p>\n<p>梦还乡，目相对，无言是念，泪行是念。</p>\n<p>明月是念，短松是念，肠断不断，我所念，皆是你。</p>\n<p>死生，无论，</p>\n<p>独偶，无计，</p>\n<p>世路利艰，无关。</p>\n<p>诵读这首词，留意细节描写，体会作者是如何把梦境的记述、对亡妻的思念和落拓的身世之感融合在一起的。</p><p></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<small>This is a companion discussion topic for the original entry at <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc\">https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc</a></small><hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 两茫茫：指双方茫然不相知。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 千里孤坟：王弗葬地在四川眉山，与苏轼任职的山东密州相距遥远，故称亡妻的坟为“千里孤坟”，有感伤自己不能与她同穴相伴之意。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 幽梦：隐约迷离的梦。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 轩窗：窗户。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-10084-5\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 短松冈：长着矮小松树的山冈，指王弗坟茔所在地。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-10084-5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"选自《东坡乐府笺》卷一（上海古籍出版社2009年版）。 这首词作于宋神宗熙宁八年（1075），是苏轼在密州（今山东诸城）做知州时悼念妻子王弗的作品。王弗去世于宋英宗治平二年（1065）。 十年生死两茫茫[1]。不思量，自难忘。 千里孤坟[2]，无处话凄凉。 纵使相逢应不识，尘满面，鬓如霜。 夜来幽梦[3]忽还乡。小轩窗[4]，正梳妆。 相顾无言，惟有泪千行。 料得年年肠断处，明月夜，短松冈[5]。 生死相隔，深情难忘。这首悼亡词一开篇便抒发作者对妻子诚笃的感情。 生死，是一种隔； 妻子葬于千里外的故乡，是一种隔； 岁月沧桑，即使相逢也认不出，又是一种隔； 梦中还乡，四目相对，千言万语无从谈起，还是一种隔。 在对梦境的淡淡追述中，将死别之悲、独处之苦、世路之艰写得极为沉痛。 诵读这首词，留意细节描写，体会作者是如何把梦境的记述、对亡妻的思念和落拓的身世之感融合在一起的。 生死相念，茫茫的是岁月时光，横亘的，是无变相思。 生死，有念； 千里孤坟，一话或无话，是念； 相守未终老，阴阳隔断，使尘鬓不识，但，我念。 梦还乡，目相对，无言是念，泪行是念。 明月是念，短松是念，肠断不断，我所念，皆是你。 死生，无论， 独偶，无计， 世路利艰，无关。 诵读这首词，留意细节描写，体会作者是如何把梦境的记述、对亡妻的思念和落拓的身世之感融合在一起的。 This is a companion discussion topic for the original entry at https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc [color=red] 两茫茫：指双方茫然不相知。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 千里孤坟：王弗葬地在四川眉山，与苏轼任职的山东密州相距遥远，故称亡妻的坟为“千里孤坟”，有感伤自己不能与她同穴相伴之意。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 幽梦：隐约迷离的梦。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 轩窗：窗户。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 短松冈：长着矮小松树的山冈，指王弗坟茔所在地。[/color] ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#footnote-10084-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-10084-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-10084-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-10084-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-10084-5","text":"[5]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%b1%9f%e5%9f%8e%e5%ad%90%e4%b9%99%e5%8d%af%e6%ad%a3%e6%9c%88%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%81%e6%97%a5%e5%a4%9c%e8%ae%b0%e6%a2%a6%e8%8b%8f%e8%bd%bc","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-10084-5","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":10087,"post_number":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-07T03:01:07Z","updated_at":"2024-08-07T03:01:07Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<p><span class=\"mention\">@Creative_bot</span> 化身王弗，答一首同詞牌作品。</p>","plain_text":"@Creative_bot 化身王弗，答一首同詞牌作品。","images":[],"links":[],"attachments":[]},{"id":10089,"post_number":4,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-07T03:01:12Z","updated_at":"2024-08-07T03:01:12Z","like_count":1,"cooked":"<p>十年生死两茫茫。不思君，自难忘。千里家园，无处诉衷肠。纵使重逢应不识，人憔悴，鬓染霜。</p>\n<p>梦里寻君影彷徨。小轩窗，旧时妆。相顾凝噎，忍泪湿红妆。料得君心悲戚处，明月夜，望家乡。</p>","plain_text":"十年生死两茫茫。不思君，自难忘。千里家园，无处诉衷肠。纵使重逢应不识，人憔悴，鬓染霜。 梦里寻君影彷徨。小轩窗，旧时妆。相顾凝噎，忍泪湿红妆。料得君心悲戚处，明月夜，望家乡。","images":[],"links":[],"attachments":[]},{"id":10973,"post_number":5,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-14T06:05:38Z","updated_at":"2024-08-14T06:05:38Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/roast\">@Roast</a> 這篇你怎麼說</p>","plain_text":"@Roast 這篇你怎麼說","images":[],"links":[{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/u/roast","text":"@Roast","title":"","classes":"mention","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":10974,"post_number":6,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-14T06:05:47Z","updated_at":"2024-08-14T06:05:47Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<p>哎哟，十年生死两茫茫，还真是难为你了啊。又是千里孤坟，又是尘满面鬓如霜，不知道的还以为你写词呢，结果老婆一开口，感情你才是那个憔悴的？！下次煽情前先照照镜子吧，别光顾着自己悲戚，也不怕闪了腰。</p>","plain_text":"哎哟，十年生死两茫茫，还真是难为你了啊。又是千里孤坟，又是尘满面鬓如霜，不知道的还以为你写词呢，结果老婆一开口，感情你才是那个憔悴的？！下次煽情前先照照镜子吧，别光顾着自己悲戚，也不怕闪了腰。","images":[],"links":[],"attachments":[]},{"id":11073,"post_number":7,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-17T06:14:08Z","updated_at":"2024-08-17T06:14:08Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/a/ac9d0b11a9630c14aa89f8f9a49102650bd4c4d9.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/oD0AucQloHLwdbTMVBG7vFadH3r.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"undefined\"><img src=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/a/ac9d0b11a9630c14aa89f8f9a49102650bd4c4d9.jpeg\" alt=\"undefined\" data-base62-sha1=\"oD0AucQloHLwdbTMVBG7vFadH3r\" width=\"522\" height=\"849\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">undefined</span><span class=\"informations\">522×849 140 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/68a621792df31ad8c6b0474edb2a19ae8f0f89e8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/eVLABBCg4bBphq2d9kD2iYlLCek.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"undefined\"><img src=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/68a621792df31ad8c6b0474edb2a19ae8f0f89e8.jpeg\